<title>RUSSIA: Russia grain crop to rise 10 mln T-minister quoted.</title>
<headline>Russia grain crop to rise 10 mln T-minister quoted.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian First Deputy Agriculture Minister Vladimir Shcherbak was quoted by Interfax news agency as saying on Tuesday that Russia's net grain harvest this year would exceed last year's by 10 million tonnes.</p>
<p>&quot;There is every reason to think that the net grain harvest in 1996 will exceed last year's by 10 million tonnes,&quot; he was quoted as telling a closed meeting of the government's Food Commission. Last year's net harvest was officially 63.4 million tonnes.</p>
</text>
